  "notes": [
    "Nav2 approach points were moved farther back from slots/parking boxes to reduce costmap inflation issues.",
    "Dock handoff poses and ArUco marker positions remain close to the target; final parking should be handled by ArUco servoing.",
    "lift_levels_mm on approach waypoints: optional per-level pre_insert/load/unload/carry overrides (see warehouse_b_approach).",
    "lift_levels_mm L1: pre_insert=0(삽입) → insert → load=6mm(들어올림) → carry=6mm(후진/이동). 2026-07-09 확정.",
    "lift_levels_mm L2: pre_insert=50mm(2층 진입) → insert → unload=43mm(파레트 놓고 후진). 리프트: 이중 HOME + SPEED 700 권장.",
    "insert: 픽셀 insert_stop_width_px 도달 후 추가 전진. 기본 INSERT_EXTRA_AFTER_VISION_M=0.11(입고/출고). 창고 A/B/C/D는 aruco_align.insert_extra_m=0.06(6cm).",
    "reverse_extra_m: dock_transfer 후진 = insert실측 + reverse_extra. 입고1/2는 0.12(슬롯 안쪽 침범 회전 방지)."
  ],
